0T19:10:33Z"},"body":"Probably missed from #64592.\r\n\r\nI found this by experimenting moving properties from `ClassDB` into `GDType`, and the `ADD_PROPERTY` there was throwing a compilation error due to not being part of a `GDCLASS` (which enables the `GDType` to be accessed).\r\n\r\nThe binds don't cause any issues otherwise, But from what I understood, non-`GDCLASS`es shouldn't be binding stuff to `ClassDB` at all.\r\n\r\nAlthough this change may be eventually done alongside moving properties from `ClassDB` to `GDType`, I think this is relevant to address.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118504/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118504/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}